    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d495">

                <pb facs="0672" n="602" sameAs="frus:frus1862/pg602"/>

                <head>Mr. Pike to Mr. Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 46.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United States Legation,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">The Hague,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1862-04-16"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 16, 1862.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to enclose you the
                    communication of this government, in reply to mine of the 22d and 28th of March
                    last, asking for a review of their position on the questions of granting
                    belligerent rights to the seceding States, and of excluding the piratical
                    vessels of those States from the ports of the Netherlands. You will perceive
                    that the government declines to change its present attitude on these
                    subjects.</p>
                <pb facs="0673" n="603" xml:id="pg603"/>
                <p>I neglected in my last to acknowledge the receipt of your despatch of March 15,
                    (No. 47.)</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with great respect, your most obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JAMES S. PIKE.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d495-a1.xml" xpointer="d495-a1"/>
            </div>
